  "description": "On a table-type recordset over C with Index PK_C (A ASC, B DESC): MoveFirst, MoveNext, hold Fields A and B and read them and Bookmark. Set Index IX_AA (A ASC, B ASC): read BOF, EOF, A, B, Bookmark; MoveNext and read A, B. Set Index \"NO_SUCH_INDEX\": read BOF, EOF, A, B. Set Index PK_C again: read A, B; MoveNext and read A, B. Asks the current row, held Field values and bookmark across an index switch. The fixture copy is opened read-only.",
